spice
*SPICE netlist for the schematic

VCC 3 0 DC 15V
VEE 7 0 DC -15V

IEE 2 3 DC 20uA

Q1 3 3 4 QNPN
Q2 3 3 3 QNPN
Q3 4 3 7 QNPN
Q4 4 5 7 QNPN
Q5 3 5 6 QPNP
Q6 6 6 7 QPNP

RC 5 7 50k
C1 5 6 10pF

ISOURCE 5 3 DC 300uA
VO 5 0

.model QNPN NPN (IS=1E-14 BF=100)
.model QPNP PNP (IS=1E-14 BF=100)

.end